20.
RESOLUTION
— Expressing the support of the Governing Body for the adoption of the
Cheyenne/Laramie County Emergency Operations Plan. (SPONSOR
— MR. ROYBAL)
Dr. Rinne joined the meeting at 12:18 p.m. during discussion of item #20 and voted on the item.
Mr. Segrave movcd to adopt, seconded by Dr. Rinne. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Jeanine West, Cheyenne/Lararnie County Management, provided a staff report. Chairman Roybal
and committee member Segrave commented on the item.
